Package: FileTree
Title: Visualize and Export File Tree Structures with Icons and Sizes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Display and export a visual representation of a directory
    tree, including colored output, file type icons, file sizes, and
    customizable depth. Supports exporting to text or markdown formats and
    recognizes a wide variety of file types including scripts, documents,
    images, compressed files and more.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    crayon
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
